A woman of the tribe of Judah living at the time of United Monarchy, only mentioned at 2Sa.14.27; 
daughter of: Absalom (H0053); married to Uriel (H0222I); 
mother of: Maacah (H4601K)
§ Tamar = "palm-tree"
1) widow of Er, the son of Judah; fiancee of Shelah, another son of Judah; wife of Judah and mother of Pharez and Zerah
2) daughter of David by Maacah, sister of Absalom, and rape victim of Amnon her half brother,…
